sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Usuario
    participant FE as Frontend (Search page)
    participant API as API /search/sanctions
    participant SS as SearchService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
    participant AUD as AuditService / audit_log

    U->>FE: Captura consulta de entidad
    FE->>API: GET /api/v1/search/sanctions?q=...
    API->>SS: search_sanctions(query, limit)

    SS->>DB: 1) Exact match (ILIKE)
    DB-->>SS: Coincidencias exactas
    SS->>DB: 2) Fuzzy match (similarity)
    DB-->>SS: Coincidencias difusas
    SS->>DB: 3) Vector search (pgvector)
    DB-->>SS: Coincidencias semanticas

    SS-->>API: Resultados consolidados
    API->>AUD: Registrar evento de busqueda
    AUD->>DB: INSERT audit_log
    DB-->>AUD: OK

    API-->>FE: JSON con resultados + resumen IA
    FE-->>U: Tabla de resultados y contexto
